# Leatherhead, Swamp Stalker (5/4) connects with Bot2 and removes her hexproof counter; Bot2 answers the reflexive trigger
# with two Lightning Bolts, killing her. "That player" is still Bot2, so the trigger's target, Mox Pearl, is legal (CR 603.12,
# 608.2b) and is destroyed even though she left combat (CR 506.4).

